+---
+id: task-003-conform-applypatch-to-rfc-6902
+type: task
+title: "Conform applyPatch to RFC 6902"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Work completed
+
+Reviewed `applyPatch` against RFC 6902 and its conformance cases. The complete patch array is now
+validated as a JSON value before evaluation, including ignored extension members. This rejects
+non-JSON JavaScript values, named array properties, and class instances while retaining RFC-required
+ignoring of additional valid JSON operation members.
+
+Added regression coverage and verified the test suite.
